      "username": "saaad_asiiif",
      "name": "Saad Asif",
      "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:33:57.715Z",
      "cooked": "<p>hii there, do not just make the entire child table read-only, because this prevents any interaction with the rows. Instead, keep the table editable and set only the fields you don’t want users to edit as read-only. This way, users can still select and delete rows while the field values remain non-editable.</p>",
