      "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:57:02.579Z",
      "cooked": "<p>frm.fields_dict.child_table.grid.update_docfield_property(field, “read_only”, 1);</p>\n<p>use this your requirement can be achieved</p>\n<p>example</p>\n<p>[‘asset_type’, ‘item_code’, ‘issued_quantity’, ‘acquired_quantity’].forEach(field =&gt; {</p>\n<pre><code>       frm.fields_dict.items.grid.update_docfield_property(field, \"read_only\", 1);\n\n   });\n</code></pre>",
